  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Promotion of Interreligious Dialogue by Ci-Paz</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aims of the initiative is to contribute to peace and social harmony in Mozambique. The objective is: creation of interfaith groups, deradicalised societies, and religious communities living in climate of peace and religious tolerance. A Centre will be established (Ci-Paz) to become a social reference point for interreligious coexistence and peace, through intereligious activities, meetings in community spaces to get to know and recognise religious as well as self-identity, awareness, respect of others and positive acceptance. Beneficiaries - religious, young people women, IDPs in Cabo delgado province; civil society and religious denominations, social actors, religious leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
